loss.backward() cal gradients of the the leaf tensors.
always use grad.zero_() to reset and avoid gradient getting added.
Rule= new_val=old_value - (learn_rate * grad) for gradient desenet.


Neural Network with nn.model

PyTorch ka wo parent class hai jisse har neural network banta hai. Jab tum apna khud ka
 model banana chahte ho, tum nn.Module se inherit karte ho.


Raw tensor can break and data is stored anywhere while in nn.model data is stored in organized manaer 
and automaticallly traced and has clean stucture.

1. Output size Should be fixed.
2. Input should match input features.


Activation Function:
 Softmax ,relu, sigmoid etc

Optimizers:
update weights like gradient descent.
SGD, Adam,

Dataset and DataLoaders:
  feeding small chunks of data aka batching




